cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
storage.23	1	storage	folder					with no data bank variable, the data bank's folder is the user's documents folder joined with the Value data bank folder
storage.24	1	storage	folder					the user's documents folder is as PLATFORMDIRS gives it for the platform, from the user's home folder
storage.25	1	storage	insert					an input's name is written within the data bank's folder as name within a folder writes it: each octet not unreserved percent-encoded, a name beginning with _ written with it doubled
storage.17	1	storage	folder					folder gives the data bank's folder
storage.1	1	storage	insert					storage only inserts into an input's relations, never deleting or altering them
storage.2	1	storage	insert					each input is kept as one MTSV file at its name within the data bank's folder, then .mtsv
storage.6	1	storage	insert					a lock older than the lock timeout is taken as released, and the lock is removed after writing
storage.13	1	storage	insert					insert converts the values from the position equal to the number the input stores, and writes the part
storage.3	1	storage	insert					a part is written at the end of its input's file, its sheets' names repeating
storage.18	1	storage	insert					a file replaced whole is written beside it, then renamed onto it, nothing left beside it
storage.4	1	storage	insert					the records of a value at or after the number of records of _stored are cut before the next part is written
storage.14	1	storage	insert					the sheets the input's schema gives are kept in _sheets.mtsv and _fields.mtsv
storage.5	1	storage	mark communicated					_communicated is kept as _communicated.mtsv in the data bank's folder
storage.7	1	storage	mark communicated					the number of an input's values communicated to a session and agent is kept in _communicated
storage.8	1	storage	insert					each value stored whole has one record in _stored, its time in UTC with the offset Z, and its event
storage.9	1	storage	insert					the value a source sends is stored as it is sent
storage.26	1	storage	insert					the value's time and event are kept only in _stored, beside it
storage.11	1	storage	inputs					inputs gives _inputs, each input in the order it was first stored, its _values the number of its records of _stored, and its _file
storage.15	1	storage	names					names gives _sheets and _fields of every input stored
storage.10	1	storage	stored					stored gives the records of _stored of the values between first and last, both included
storage.12	1	storage	inputs	keeping failed	keeping failed			a file system failure ends the access as keeping failed
storage.16	1	storage	insert	non-conforming	0 #			an input the converter rejects ends the insert as non-conforming, nothing being stored
storage.19	1	storage	inputs					a file of the data bank that does not exist is read as holding no record
storage.20	1	storage	mark communicated					a session holding HT is not kept in _communicated, nothing being marked communicated to it
storage.21	1	storage	relations					relations gives the input's relations, the records of the values below the number of its records of _stored
storage.22	1	storage	communicated					communicated gives the number of the input's values communicated to the session and agent
